---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ArticleSchema from '../../components/ArticleSchema.astro';
import { site, description, pageTitle } from '../../content';

const path = '/use-cases/loyalty';
const title = pageTitle(site, 'use-cases/loyalty');
const desc = description(site, 'use-cases/loyalty');
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={desc} site={site} path={path}>
  <ArticleSchema title={title} description={desc} siteName={site.name} domain={site.domain} path={path} />
  <section class="container py-16">
    <a href="/use-cases" class="link text-sm font-bold">← All use cases</a>
    <h1 class="hero-title mt-5">Coordinate loyalty rewards with cart recovery</h1>
    <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-slate-700">A loyalty operator needs accurate reward balances and clear redemption rules, rather than another discount sequence.</p>
    <article class="prose-shopify card mt-12 max-w-4xl p-8">
      <h2>Choose the reward event</h2>
      <p>Separate earning points, receiving usable points, reaching a tier and approaching a real expiry date. Define which system owns the balance and program terms. A pending reward should not be described as spendable. Choose entry from a confirmed ledger change rather than a repeated order webhook.</p>
      <h2>Respect reversals and existing promises</h2>
      <p>Specify how cancellations, partial returns and exchanged items affect points. Decide whether a tier benefit survives a later return; customer-facing terms and automation should agree. Do not automatically exclude a customer because they used a discount. Resolve eligibility from the program rules, not a label such as coupon hunter.</p>
      <h2>Make recovery aware of redemption</h2>
      <p>Before a cart reminder promises savings, check whether points are already applied and whether the proposed offer can combine with them. Explain the choice between rewards and a code when they cannot stack. A balance reminder should link to the account or redemption destination, with a fallback for a guest who cannot authenticate.</p>
      <h2>Select the integration by ledger behavior</h2>
      <p>Evaluate a loyalty system for earning and reversal records, and a messaging system for receiving those changes. Sequenzy or another lifecycle candidate belongs on the shortlist only if it can demonstrate the required handoff. Ask for an export showing event identity, balance freshness and failed updates; this page does not establish any supplier capability.</p>
      <h2>Proposed acceptance exercise</h2>
      <p>Award pending points, release them, redeem some and partially refund the order in a staff account. Confirm one notification per qualifying change and the correct remaining balance. Compare repeat contribution and reward liability, including non-redeemers, rather than declaring success from redemption volume alone.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
